              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nzek 12.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ndeto ya Yeova wa nguthu yambũkĩe, ĩkĩmbĩa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neena na andũ onthe ma ĩ nthĩ, na athembi, ũkĩkũlya, Yĩla mwatĩĩie kũya na mwameta mwei wa katano na wa mũonza, o myaka ĩsu mĩongo mũonza, mwaatĩĩa nongi kũya nũndũ wakwa, nyie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
